DTSTAMP:20260905T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260522
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261014
SUMMARY:Yosemite: Half Dome cables season 2026
DESCRIPTION:The cables go up the Friday before Memorial Day and come down t
 he day after the second Monday in October\, conditions permitting. No perm
 it is issued for a day outside the season. Source: https://www.nps.gov/yos
 e/planyourvisit/hdpermits.htm. Verified 2026-09-05. The Talus Field\, http
 s://thetalusfieldjournal.com/dates
URL:https://thetalusfieldjournal.com/dates
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Yosemite: Half Dome cables season 2026
TRIGGER:-P1D
END:VALARM
