BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:firefall@dates.thetalusfieldjournal.com
DTSTAMP:20260905T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260210
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260227
RRULE:FREQ=YEARLY
SUMMARY:Yosemite: Horsetail Fall (Firefall) window
DESCRIPTION:The sun lines up with Horsetail Fall in the second half of Febr
 uary. In 2026 the park's projected window was February 10 to 26\, with no 
 reservation required. The fall only glows if there is water in it and the 
 western sky is clear. Typical window\, not a published date\; the park ann
 ounces the day a few days ahead. Source: https://www.nps.gov/yose/learn/ne
 ws/yosemite-national-park-prepares-for-2026-horsetail-fall-viewing.htm. Ve
 rified 2026-09-05. The Talus Field\, https://thetalusfieldjournal.com/date
 s
URL:https://thetalusfieldjournal.com/dates
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Yosemite: Horsetail Fall (Firefall) window
TRIGGER:-P1D
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:glacier-point-open@dates.thetalusfieldjournal.com
DTSTAMP:20260905T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260501
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260601
RRULE:FREQ=YEARLY
SUMMARY:Yosemite: Glacier Point Road typically opens
DESCRIPTION:Glacier Point Road usually opens in May once plowing is done\; 
 in 2026 it opened May 9. The park announces the date a few days ahead. Cha
 ins can still be required in the first weeks. Typical window\, not a publi
 shed date\; the park announces the day a few days ahead. Source: https://w
 ww.nps.gov/yose/planyourvisit/glacierpointroad.htm. Verified 2026-09-05. T
 he Talus Field\, https://thetalusfieldjournal.com/dates
URL:https://thetalusfieldjournal.com/dates
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Yosemite: Glacier Point Road typically opens
TRIGGER:-P1D
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:tioga-open@dates.thetalusfieldjournal.com
DTSTAMP:20260905T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260515
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260701
RRULE:FREQ=YEARLY
SUMMARY:Yosemite: Tioga Road typically opens
DESCRIPTION:Tioga Road has opened between late April and early July over th
 e record\; late May to mid-June is the usual range\, and 2026 opened May 1
 5. The park posts plowing progress weekly and announces the opening a day 
 or two ahead. Typical window\, not a published date\; the park announces t
 he day a few days ahead. Source: https://www.nps.gov/yose/planyourvisit/ti
 ogaopen.htm. Verified 2026-09-05. The Talus Field\, https://thetalusfieldj
 ournal.com/dates
URL:https://thetalusfieldjournal.com/dates
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Yosemite: Tioga Road typically opens
TRIGGER:-P1D
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:tioga-close@dates.thetalusfieldjournal.com
DTSTAMP:20260905T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261101
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261201
RRULE:FREQ=YEARLY
SUMMARY:Yosemite: Tioga Road typically closes
DESCRIPTION:Tioga Road closes for the season with the first storm that stic
 ks\, usually in November. Services in Tuolumne Meadows close weeks earlier
 : after mid-September a day up high is drive-yourself and self-supported. 
 Typical window\, not a published date\; the park announces the day a few d
 ays ahead. Source: https://www.nps.gov/yose/planyourvisit/tiogaopen.htm. V
 erified 2026-09-05. The Talus Field\, https://thetalusfieldjournal.com/dat
 es
URL:https://thetalusfieldjournal.com/dates
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Yosemite: Tioga Road typically closes
TRIGGER:-P1D
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:tuolumne-shuttle-2026@dates.thetalusfieldjournal.com
DTSTAMP:20260905T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260913
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260914
SUMMARY:Yosemite: Tuolumne Meadows shuttle and hikers bus end
DESCRIPTION:The Tuolumne shuttle and the Valley-to-Tuolumne hikers bus stop
  for 2026 on September 13. The Tuolumne store and grill close September 20
 . Tioga Road itself stays open until the snow closes it. Source: https://w
 ww.nps.gov/yose/planyourvisit/tmbus.htm. Verified 2026-09-05. The Talus Fi
 eld\, https://thetalusfieldjournal.com/dates
URL:https://thetalusfieldjournal.com/dates
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Yosemite: Tuolumne Meadows shuttle and hikers bus end
TRIGGER:-P1D
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:grove-shuttle-2026@dates.thetalusfieldjournal.com
DTSTAMP:20260905T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260503
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261101
SUMMARY:Yosemite: Mariposa Grove shuttle season
DESCRIPTION:The free shuttle from the Welcome Plaza to the grove runs May 3
  to October 31\, 2026\, with November service 8 to 3:30 and none from Dece
 mber to mid-April. When it is off\, the Washburn Trail is 2 miles and 500 
 feet up to the trees. Source: https://www.nps.gov/yose/planyourvisit/mg.ht
 m. Verified 2026-09-05. The Talus Field\, https://thetalusfieldjournal.com
 /dates
URL:https://thetalusfieldjournal.com/dates
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Yosemite: Mariposa Grove shuttle season
TRIGGER:-P1D
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
END:VCALENDAR
